      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The \"War Demons' Hideout\" is apparently accessed by \r\nwind-swept vertical shaft near Betland Bridge, \r\na common patrol area for the orc army.",
        "Jp" : "でだ、奴らのアジト《戦鬼の影穴》は\r\nオーク軍の出没が多い《バートランド大橋》近くの\r\n\"風の吹き込む縦穴\"から続いているらしい"
