      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Based on that clue, an advance party went to\r\ninvestigate that area three days ago. \r\nThe fact that they haven't returned...",
        "Jp" : "それを手がかりに先発隊がその辺りを\r\n調べにいったのが、３日前\r\nさすがにもう帰っていないとおかしい――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286371,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Could you follow the same lead and look into\r\nthe War Demons' Hideout?",
        "Jp" : "《戦鬼の影穴》について\r\nお前も同じ手掛かりで追ってみてくれないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286372,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The real objective is to eliminate the orc\r\ncommander hiding there. He's Mogok's right-hand\r\nman, Gesomu the War Demon.",
        "Jp" : "真の目的は、そこにいるであろう\r\n潜伏したオーク部隊の指揮官、\r\nモゴックの腹心《戦鬼ゲソム》の討伐だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286373,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
