      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I see... \r\nSo their hideout was connected \r\nto that dry well? \r\n\r\nAnd you took down Gesomu the War Demon?!",
        "Jp" : "なるほど――\r\n奴らのアジトはあの枯れ井戸から\r\n続いていたのか\r\nしかも《戦鬼ゲソム》を倒したのか！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286376,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Incredible! You defeated the Orc Commander\r\nand even took out the underlings to boot.",
        "Jp" : "大したもんだ！！\r\nオーク指揮官を倒し、小部隊までみごと\r\n蹴散らすなんてな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286377,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But I have some bad news. Turns out that \"Gesomu\r\nthe War Demon\" isn't the orc's name but a title\r\ngiven to the leader of their unit.",
        "Jp" : "――だがこっちから一つ悪い報せがある\r\n《戦鬼ゲソム》というのはオークの名というより\r\n部隊の長に与えられる階級の渾名らしい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286378,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Meaning, there could easily be a second or third\r\nGesomu lurking around. We'll need to keep\r\nmonitoring the area.",
        "Jp" : "つまり、第二第三のゲソムがたむろする\r\n可能性も十分あるってことだ\r\n引き続き監視していく必要があるな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286379,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
