      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Man, you're really something! No wonder the\r\ncaptain and vice-captain respect you. I'm proud to\r\ncall you my rival.",
        "Jp" : "いやぁ、それにしてもやっぱすごいよお前は！\r\n統率と副隊長が一目置くだけはあるよ\r\n俺もライバルとして鼻が高いな、うん"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286380,
